---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Angie Wang" description="Writer, creator, podcast host. Writing about cross-cultural life, creative expression, and becoming.">
  <section class="hero-section section">
    <div class="container hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <h1>I'm Angie from Taiwan. I am <mark>deeply curious</mark> and a lifelong learner, discovering myself over and over again through art, movement, writing, and motherhood.</h1>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-quote">
        <blockquote>
          <p>She is a far better writer than me. I hope that I can write about the world like she can by the time I turn 60. Also her book is going to be amazing.</p>
          <cite>— Paul, my husband (he put this here)</cite>
        </blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="story-section section">
    <div class="container story-inner">
      <div class="story-image">
        <img src="/images/about-angie.jpg" alt="Angie" />
      </div>
      <div class="story-text">
        <h2>The Quick Story</h2>
        <p>I was an "excellent sheep" that felt lost and disconnected in the adult game until I found my mind-body connection again through <a href="/tag/powerlifting/">lifting</a> and embarked on my own hero's journey. I later created podcasts and online courses to help people cultivate awareness and empowerment through lifting.</p>
        <p>Online creation unlocked my inner child and sparked my interest in other more fluid creative experiments like movement, writing, and art. Now I'm exploring how to help people connect with their creative power, get unstuck, embark on their own heroes' journeys, and live the beautiful life they deserve to live.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="three-col-section section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="three-col-grid">
        <div class="col-card">
          <h3>I Wrote a Book</h3>
          <p>I wrote my Chinese memoir <em>Made in Taiwan</em> that tells the story of me being Taiwanese, and how I perceived my identity changes over time. This includes studying in the States, quitting my 9-5, becoming an online creator and digital nomad, marrying into a white family, and becoming a mother.</p>
          <a href="https://mit886.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="learn-more">Learn More &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="col-card">
          <h3>Angie Creates Newsletter</h3>
          <p>I write an English Newsletter called <a href="https://angiecreates.substack.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><em>Angie Creates</em></a> sharing my life reflections, cross-cultural family stories and my memoir writing process.</p>
          <iframe src="https://angiecreates.substack.com/embed" width="100%" height="150" style="border:none; background:transparent;" frameborder="0" scrolling="no"></iframe>
        </div>
        <div class="col-card">
          <h3>I'm Having Conversations On My Podcast</h3>
          <p>I have conversations with artists, creators, writers, parents, digital nomads, and more.</p>
          <a href="/podcast/" class="learn-more">Learn More &rarr;</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="hats-section section">
    <div class="container hats-container">
      <h2>My Different Hats</h2>
      <ul class="hats-list">
        <li><strong>Digital Creation:</strong> I host the <a href="https://angiecreates.transistor.fm/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Angie Creates Podcast</a>, built a Be Your Own Coach online course, started an online sports science community, and write extensively about identity and life design.</li>
        <li><strong>Creative Writing:</strong> I wrote extensively about <a href="https://crossing.cw.com.tw/article/15321" target="_blank" rel="noopener">digital nomad</a> and <a href="/marriage-04-solopreneur/">cultural identity</a>, <a href="/no-one-loves-you-like-you-do/">narratives of self</a>, life design. I wrote my Chinese memoir <em>Made in Taiwan</em>, published in Taiwan in March 2026.</li>
        <li><strong>Movement:</strong> I'm a capoeira and Ido Portal's movement culture lover. Fascinated about anatomy train, NKT, and methods that uncover the relationship between physical body and emotion (like Cranial Sacral Therapy).</li>
        <li><strong>Art:</strong> I love <a href="https://x.com/angiewangcreate" target="_blank" rel="noopener">watercolor</a> and botanical drawing and enjoy learning about different mediums and styles of creations.</li>
        <li><strong>Freelance:</strong> I'm a trained qualitative researcher and helped tech companies with the user and product research (with in-depth interviews and focus groups) and building MVPs.</li>
        <li><strong>Human:</strong> I'm from Taiwan and live with my fun and nerdy husband <a href="https://pmillerd.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Paul Millerd</a> and our daughter Mumu. We love deep and curious conversations and hosting meet-ups, book clubs, and accountability groups.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Currently Exploring</h2>
      <ul class="hats-list">
        <li>How to live the most alive version of myself</li>
        <li>How our narratives are formed and how to transcend them if these narratives don't serve us (especially with Neural Linguistic Programming)</li>
        <li>How to empower kids and adults through creative expressions like art, movement, and life design</li>
        <li>Spanish and Portuguese</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Fun Facts</h2>
      <ul class="hats-list">
        <li>I once won a deadlift competition with a lift of 225 lbs in the 110lb class.</li>
        <li>Chiang Mai is my spiritual hometown, and Oaxaca is my favorite city to live in the world.</li>
        <li>My favorite books: <em>Pathless Path</em>, <em>Reboot</em>, <em>The Artist Way</em>, <em>Designing Your Life</em>, <em>The Normal Chaos of Love</em>, <em>The Art of Learning</em>, <em>One Hundred Years of Solitude</em>.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="connect-section section">
    <div class="container connect-inner">
      <h2>Hang With Me</h2>
      <p>If you resonate with what I share here, let's be friends! You can chat with me on <a href="https://x.com/angiewangcreate" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Twitter</a>, follow me on <a href="https://www.instagram.com/angiewangcreates" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>, or subscribe to my <a href="https://angiecreates.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">newsletter</a>.</p>
      <div class="social-links">
        <a href="https://www.instagram.com/angiewangcreates" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Instagram</a>
        <a href="https://x.com/angiewangcreate" target="_blank" rel="noopener">X / Twitter</a>
        <a href="https://angiecreates.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">English Newsletter</a>
        <a href="https://mit886.substack.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">中文電子報</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* ── Hero ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .hero-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.5fr 1fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-section h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    font-weight: 400;
  }

  .hero-section mark {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, transparent 60%, var(--color-accent) 60%);
    padding: 0 4px;
  }

  .hero-quote blockquote {
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-style: italic;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--color-accent);
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero-quote cite {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--color-text-muted);
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-style: normal;
  }

  /* ── Story ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .story-section {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
  }

  .story-inner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .story-image img {
    width: 100%;
    border-radius: 12px;
    object-fit: cover;
    max-height: 500px;
  }

  /* ── Three Columns ─────────────────────────────────── */
  .three-col-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .col-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .col-card p {
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  .col-card iframe {
    border: none;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    border-radius: 8px;
  }

  .col-card:has(iframe) {
    background: #fff;
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.25rem;
  }

  .learn-more {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .learn-more:hover {
    color: var(--color-dark);
  }

  /* ── Hats ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .hats-section {
    background: var(--color-bg-alt);
  }

  .hats-container {
    max-width: 800px;
  }

  .hats-list {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.5rem;
    margin-top: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .hats-list li {
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  /* ── Connect ──────────────────────────────────────── */
  .connect-section {
    text-align: center;
  }

  .connect-inner > p {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
    color: var(--color-text-light);
  }

  .social-links {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .social-links a {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    padding: 0.5rem 1.25rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: 20px;
    color: var(--color-text);
    transition: all 0.15s ease;
  }

  .social-links a:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-accent);
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  /* ── Responsive ──────────────────────────────────── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .hero-inner,
    .story-inner {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .story-image {
      order: -1;
    }

    .three-col-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
